<DIV class="nry_con">
<DIV class="con">
<P class="tit">西安电子科技大学关于组织申报拔尖创新人才培养改革项目的通知</P>
<P class="zd"><SPAN>2022-04-06&nbsp;&nbsp;</SPAN><SPAN>审核人：<!--</SPAN><span style="color:red;">审核人参数配置未打开</span><SPAN>-->&nbsp;&nbsp;(已浏览<script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1070628979, 11412)</script>)</SPAN></P>
     
    <p>
        <UL style="list-style-type:none;margin-bottom:30px;"> 
            <li>附件【<a href="/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1070628979&wbfileid=5BFCD59CDBF15029BD5C05F61CA3CB8D" target="_blank">附件1：2022年西安电子科技大学拔尖创新人才培养改革项目申报书.doc</a>】已下载<span id="nattach5381705"><script language="javascript">getClickTimes(5381705,1070628979,"wbnewsfile","attach")</script></span>次</li>
            <li>附件【<a href="/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1070628979&wbfileid=113B1DC08952D18843411DCB39346F9D" target="_blank">附件2：2022拔尖创新人才培养改革项目申报汇总表.xls</a>】已下载<span id="nattach5381706"><script language="javascript">getClickTimes(5381706,1070628979,"wbnewsfile","attach")</script></span>次</li>
        </UL>
    </p>
    <div id="vsb_content" class="ny"><div class="v_news_content">
<style><!--  /* Font Definitions */  @font-face {font-family:宋体; panose-1:2 1 6 0 3 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:黑体; panose-1:2 1 6 9 6 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"Cambria Math"; panose-1:2 4 5 3 5 4 6 3 2 4;} @font-face {font-family:方正小标宋简体;} @font-face {font-family:仿宋_GB2312;} @font-face {font-family:楷体_GB2312;} @font-face {font-family:"\@宋体"; panose-1:2 1 6 0 3 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"\@黑体"; panose-1:2 1 6 9 6 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"\@方正小标宋简体";} @font-face {font-family:"\@仿宋_GB2312";} @font-face {font-family:"\@楷体_GB2312";}  /* Style Definitions */  p.MsoNormal, li.MsoNormal, div.MsoNormal {margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-size:10.5pt; font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";} p.MsoHeader, li.MsoHeader, div.MsoHeader {margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; vsb_temp-mode:char; border:none; padding:0cm; font-size:9.0pt; font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";} p.MsoFooter, li.MsoFooter, div.MsoFooter {mso-style-link:"页脚 Char"; margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; vsb_temp-mode:char; font-size:9.0pt; font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";} a:link, span.MsoHyperlink {color:blue; text-decoration:underline;} a:visited, span.MsoHyperlinkFollowed {color:purple; text-decoration:underline;} span.Char {mso-style-name:"页脚 Char"; mso-style-link:页脚;} span.a {mso-style-name:"页脚 字符";}  /* Page Definitions */  @page Section1 {size:595.3pt 841.9pt; margin:7.0cm 73.7pt 3.0cm 79.4pt; vsb_temp:15.6pt 0pt; size:595.3pt 841.9pt !msorm; margin:7.0cm 73.7pt 3.0cm 79.4pt !msorm; vsb_temp:15.6pt 0pt !msorm; page-break-before:always !msorm;} div.Section1 {page:Section1;} @page Section2 {size:595.3pt 841.9pt; margin:3.0cm 73.7pt 3.0cm 79.4pt; vsb_temp:15.6pt;} div.Section2 {page:Section2;} @page Section3 {size:841.9pt 595.3pt; margin:73.7pt 70.9pt 73.7pt 70.9pt; vsb_temp:15.6pt 0pt;} div.Section3 {page:Section3;} --></style>
<div class="Section1" style="vsb_temp: 15.6pt 0pt;">
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; -ms-text-justify: distribute-all-lines;"><br></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center; line-height: 28pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;"></span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: -24pt; margin-left: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">各单位：</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 30.4pt;"><span style="letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">为贯彻落实《教育部等六部门关于实施基础学科拔尖学生培养计划<span lang="EN-US">2.0</span>的意见》以及《教育部、工业和信息化部、中国工程院关于加快建设发展新工科 实施卓越工程师教育培养计划<span lang="EN-US">2.0</span>的意见》精神，探索形成具有西电特色的拔尖创新人才培养体系，培养适应和引领科技发展领军人才、专家学者和行业精英。</span><span style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">学校决定，近期组织开展拔尖创新人才培养改革项目立项建设工作。现就有关事项通知如下：</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 29.2pt;"><span style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;">一、立项类型和</span><span style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;">内容</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 29.2pt;"><span style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">本次立项分重点项目和一般项目两种类型，针对拔尖班、卓越班</span></p>
</div>
<p><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;"><br clear="all" style="page-break-before: always;"> </span> </p>
<div class="Section2" style="vsb_temp: 15.6pt;">
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt;"><span style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">班、教改班、特色班四类实验班，立项内容主要分为四部分：</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 29.2pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">1.</span><span style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">数理、英语基础课程改革。结合国际国内一流高校课程大纲，引育并举课程资源，推进实验班数理、英语基础课程内容进行深入改革，体现“高阶性、创新性、挑战度”，提倡智能化改革。课程大纲须按照每种实验班的定位与培养目标进行知识点、内容的全面梳理，落实“厚基础”，凸出差异性、特色化。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 29.2pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">2.</span><span style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">大类基础课程改革。拔尖班、教改班课程改革的内容要保持一定的“高阶性、创新性、挑战度”，课程形式上，要体现新技术与教育教学的深度融合；卓越班以学科竞赛为引领，推动理论与实践融合改革，以竞赛有效参赛为产出并可纳入学生的课程考核。推动实验室授课、项目制学习常态化。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 29.2pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">3.</span><span style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">实验实践改革。注重教学理念和体系改革，分模块分层次改革实验实践教学体系、实验实践教学模式、实验实践平台构建等关键环节。卓越班校企联合培养相关环节改革。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 29.2pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">4.</span><span style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">其它实验班改革内容。相关实施环节落实、培养方案修订、课程体系改革、本硕博一贯制培养、学生选拔科学鉴才、评价机制改革、科教融合探索、流动机制改革等支撑各类实验班特色化实施的项目。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 29.2pt;"><span style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;">二、立项范围</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 29.2pt;"><span style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">面向学校四大类（拔尖班、卓越班、教改班、特色班）<span lang="EN-US">17</span>个实验班，鼓励学院牵头，以实验班实施、改革为主线，集课程设置、教学内容、教学方法、教学手段、教学管理等改革于一体的系统改革；鼓励申报具有共性和实践性的项目，特别是能够破解各类实验班运行、改革过程中的某些重点、难点问题。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 29.2pt;"><span style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;">三、项目申报要求</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 29.2pt;"><span style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">按照“分类指导、鼓励特色、重在改革、突出实效”的原则，具体要求如下：</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 29.2pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">1.</span><span style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">立项类型中的前两类由学校统筹规划，由公共课程负责人牵头负责；实验实践改革原则上须由实验班负责人牵头，实验班实验实践课程授课教师为成员共同推进；最后一类由学院牵头，按照实验班类型形成总体改革项目。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 29.2pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">2.</span><span style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">本次立项学校将给予经费资助，资助额度根据各项目申请经费进评估确定，鼓励项目整合申报，不予资助<span lang="EN-US">1</span>万元以下项目。项目实施周期为<span lang="EN-US">1</span>年内。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 29.2pt;"><span style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;">四、项目经费使用范围及改革奖励</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 29.2pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">1.</span><span style="letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">项目经费可用于支持相关调研、购买实验器材、耗材、改善实验室条件、聘请高水平教师授课、课程引进等符合财务报销要求的支出。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 29.2pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">2.</span><span style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">项目经年终验收达到合格以上等级的将在年终绩效、学院年度考核中予以核拨和奖励；改革效果显著（经学校评审）的教师个人将在<span lang="EN-US">2022</span>年优质教学奖中予以直接认定并给予相应等级的奖励；此次立项项目认定为校级教改项目。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 29.2pt;"><span style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;">五、申报材料及报送要求</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 29.2pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">1.</span><span style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">申报者认真填写《<span lang="EN-US">2022</span>年西安电子科技大学拔尖创新人才培养改革项目申报书》（一式三份，见<span lang="EN-US"><a href="http://www.snedu.com/FCKeditor/UserFiles/File/fujian222.doc"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: none;"><span lang="EN-US">附件1</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: none;"><span lang="EN-US">，以下简称“申报书”</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: none;"><span lang="EN-US">）</span></span></a></span>。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 29.2pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">2.</span><span style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">各学院认真填写《<span lang="EN-US">2022</span>拔尖创新人才培养改革项目申报汇总表》（一式一份见<span lang="EN-US"><a href="http://www.snedu.com/FCKeditor/UserFiles/File/fujian333.doc"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: none;"><span lang="EN-US">附件2</span></span></a></span>，用<span lang="EN-US">Excel</span>格式填写，以下简称“汇总表”）。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 29.2pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">3.</span><span style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">请各学院于<span lang="EN-US">2022</span>年<span lang="EN-US">4</span>月<span lang="EN-US">20</span>日前将申报书和汇总表，经各单位</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt;"><span style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">主管教学的领导签字并加盖公章后报送教务处教学研究科，并将申报书和汇总表电子版（电子文档的文件名格式为“学院名<span lang="EN-US">+</span>主持人姓名”）由各单位统一发送至：<span lang="EN-US" style="color: black;"><a href="mailto:jyk@xidian.edu.cn"><span style="color: black; text-decoration: none;">jyk@xidian.edu.cn</span></a></span>。逾期不予受理。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 29.2pt;"><span style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">附件不随本文印发，请到教务处网站下载。请相关学院高度重视，认真组织，及时沟通，保证本次项目立项工作顺利进行。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: -58.4pt; margin-left: 90.3pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: -58.4pt; margin-left: 90.3pt;"><span style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">附件：<span lang="EN-US"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: none;">1.2022</span><span lang="EN-US" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: none;"><span lang="EN-US">年西安电子科技大学拔尖创新人才培养改革项目申报书</span></span> </span></span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: -14.6pt; margin-left: 93.05pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">2.2022</span><span style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">拔尖创新人才培养改革项目申报汇总表 </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: -16pt; margin-left: 94.45pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: -16pt; margin-left: 94.45pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 192pt; margin-left: 88.95pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">本科生院</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 256pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">2022</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">年<span lang="EN-US">4</span>月<span lang="EN-US">6</span>日</span></p>
 <span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; font-family: 黑体; font-size: 15pt;"><br clear="all" style="page-break-before: always;"> </span> 
 <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color: black; font-family: 黑体; font-size: 15pt;"><br></span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; font-family: 黑体; font-size: 15pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; font-family: 黑体; font-size: 15pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
